{
  "info": {
    "name": "Tamagotchi Go \u2014 Tamagotchi service (Artur)",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "description": "Player routes for the Tamagotchi service. Runs against the team stack (`python3 scripts/lab.py up`, port 8085) or a locally started service. Auth is mocked on player routes: the bearer token is the user id. The opt-in \u201cInternal routes (mTLS)\u201d folder exercises the existing service-to-service routes over local mTLS; see its description and compose.postman.internal.yaml."
  },
